## Secrets - Centraly.Api's appsettings.json holds a real DB password + JWT key.
## Commit appsettings.Example.json instead; each dev keeps their own real file locally.
## (Centraly.Desktop/appsettings.json has no secrets - just a local LocalDB connection
## string with Trusted_Connection - so it stays tracked for an out-of-the-box clone.)
Centraly.Api/appsettings.json
Centraly.Api/appsettings.Development.json
!**/appsettings.Example.json

